  "_meta": {
    "source": "CreativeTechGuy/PalworldDBIndex (DT_PalMonsterParameter.json, PalIcon/Normal/Yakushima portraits) cross-checked with oMaN-Rod/palworld-save-pal pals.json + l10n/en",
    "notes": "11 Terraria 'Tides of Terraria' crossover Pals (internal tribe YakushimaMonster/YakushimaBoss). ALL are non-breedable: the raw datamine flags IgnoreCombi=True and ZukanIndex=-1 (no real Paldeck number), and none appear in DT_PalCombiUnique -- so combiRank/combiDuplicatePriority set to null and ignoreCombi=true (the CombiRank=3100/Priority=310000 seen in the tables is the engine's default sentinel for ignored Pals, NOT a real breeding rank; not used). Because there is no official Paldeck index, dex ids are synthetic T01-T11 (T=Tides of Terraria collab). Elements/works/stats/rarity/size are real datamined values. Selyne (internal MoonQueen, dex 190) was ALREADY present -- not re-added. Moon Lord (RAID_YakushimaBoss002) and True Eye of Cthulhu (RAID_YakushimaBoss001_Green) are raid bosses (IsBoss=true, no element, not catchable in Paldeck) -- excluded. partnerSkill omitted (null): these Pals have no named partner skill in DT_PartnerSkillParameter (ActiveSkill 'Unknown'). drops=['Yakushima Ingot'] (internal item YakushimaIngot001, the collab material each drops). Slug convention: name.toLowerCase() then strip everything except [a-z0-9] -> e.g. 'Eye of Cthulhu' -> 'eyeofcthulhu.png'. Portraits resized 128x128 -> 100x100 to match existing img/*.png."
  }
